      "value": "As I found out later this is most likely not easily feasible for VRChat as the shaders would have to be redone to support it\nand as some people make use of older Unity shaders for Quest avatars and Worlds can use practically any shader PC or Quest\nit wouldn't be easily doable\none idea I've heard for it \nwould be worlds/avatars that could have support for it\nand could be marked like game maps/optimized-fallback avatars\nSo if you/(everyone in view) are/is wearing/using a supported avatar in a supported world\nthe feature would be enabled if not it is disabled",
